---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../styles/home.css';
---

<Layout>
  <main class="home">
    <section class="home-hero">

      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="hero-eyebrow">
          Systems · Networking · Automation
        </p>

        <h1 class="hero-title">
          <span>Jonas</span>
          <span>Németh</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="hero-intro">
          I work with systems administration, and spend much of my spare time
          on projects involving Linux, networking, automation and embedded systems.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="hero-primary" href="/projects">
            View projects <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>

          <a class="hero-secondary" href="/cv">
            View CV
          </a>

          <a
            class="hero-secondary"
            href="https://github.com/Pdoxxy"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noreferrer"
          >
            GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-visual" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="visual-grid"></div>

        <div class="visual-node node-one">
          <span></span>
          HUGIN
        </div>

        <div class="visual-node node-two">
          <span></span>
          HOMELAB
        </div>

        <div class="visual-node node-three">
          <span></span>
          BACHELOR PROJECT
        </div>

        <div class="visual-core">
          <span>PROJECTS</span>
        </div>
        <svg
          class="visual-links"
          viewBox="0 0 100 100"
          preserveAspectRatio="none"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <line x1="50" y1="50" x2="15" y2="22" />
          <line x1="50" y1="50" x2="80" y2="28" />
          <line x1="50" y1="50" x2="18" y2="82" />
        </svg>
      </div>

    </section>


    <section class="project-showcase hugin-showcase">
      <div class="project-stage">

        <div class="project-copy">
          <div class="project-number">01</div>

          <p class="project-label">Embedded systems · Home automation</p>

          <h2>Hugin</h2>

          <p class="project-lead">
            One sensor platform instead of a room full of separate devices.
          </p>

          <p class="project-description">
            A local-first room sensor platform combining presence and environmental
            sensing with ESP32, ESPHome and Home Assistant.
          </p>

          <a class="project-link" href="/projects/hugin">
            Explore Hugin <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="project-visual hugin-visual" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="sensor-ring ring-outer"></div>
          <div class="sensor-ring ring-inner"></div>

          <div class="sensor-core">
            <span>HUGIN</span>
            <strong>ROOM 01</strong>
          </div>

          <span class="sensor-data data-presence">PRESENCE</span>
          <span class="sensor-data data-environment">ENVIRONMENT</span>
          <span class="sensor-data data-local">LOCAL</span>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="project-showcase homelab-showcase">
      <div class="project-stage">

        <div class="project-copy">
          <div class="project-number">02</div>

          <p class="project-label">
            Linux · Networking · Self-hosting
          </p>

          <h2>Homelab</h2>

          <p class="project-lead">
            My home server that grew into a homelab.
          </p>

          <p class="project-description">
            I use it to run services at home and to learn more about Linux,
            Docker, networking and automation along the way.
          </p>

          <a class="project-link" href="/projects/homelab">
            Explore Homelab <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="project-visual homelab-visual" aria-hidden="true">

          <div class="network-line"></div>

          <div class="network-node node-internet">
            <span>01</span>
            <strong>INTERNET</strong>
          </div>

          <div class="network-node node-gateway">
            <span>02</span>
            <strong>GATEWAY</strong>
          </div>

          <div class="network-node node-server">
            <span>03</span>
            <strong>LINUX SERVER</strong>
          </div>

          <div class="network-node node-services">
            <span>04</span>
            <strong>DOCKER SERVICES</strong>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="project-showcase bachelor-showcase">
      <div class="project-stage">

        <div class="project-copy">
          <div class="project-number">03</div>

          <p class="project-label">
            Chalmers · Networking · Software development
          </p>

          <h2>Bachelor Project</h2>

          <p class="project-lead">
            Exploring a network-driven approach to detecting missing computers.
          </p>

          <p class="project-description">
            In a six-person Chalmers team, we researched, designed and built a system
            for monitoring shared computers using network discovery, heartbeat signals
            and a central backend.
          </p>

          <a class="project-link" href="/projects/bachelor-project">
            Explore project <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="project-visual heartbeat-visual" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg
          class="heartbeat-links"
          viewBox="0 0 100 100"
          preserveAspectRatio="none"
        >
          <line class="heartbeat-path path-one" x1="22" y1="22" x2="50" y2="50" />
          <line class="heartbeat-path path-two" x1="78" y1="24" x2="50" y2="50" />
          <line class="heartbeat-path path-three" x1="22" y1="78" x2="50" y2="50" />
          <line class="heartbeat-path path-four" x1="78" y1="76" x2="50" y2="50" />
        </svg>
          <div class="heartbeat-monitor">
            <span>MONITOR</span>
            <strong>DEVICE STATUS</strong>
          </div>

          <div class="heartbeat-device device-one">
            <span class="status-dot"></span>
            PC-01
          </div>

          <div class="heartbeat-device device-two">
            <span class="status-dot"></span>
            PC-02
          </div>

          <div class="heartbeat-device device-three">
            <span class="status-dot"></span>
            PC-03
          </div>

          <div class="heartbeat-device device-four">
            <span class="status-dot"></span>
            PC-04
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="home-closing">
      <div class="closing-label">
        <span>04</span>
        <span>About</span>
      </div>

      <div class="closing-content">
        <p class="closing-statement">
          Most of my projects start with a need.
          <span>Then comes the question: can I build it myself?</span>
        </p>

        <div class="closing-details">
          <p>
            I work with systems administration, primarily Melior,
            and have studied Information Technology at Chalmers. Outside work,
            that curiosity has led to everything from running my own server and
            network to building sensors and automations.
          </p>

          <div class="closing-links">
            <a href="/about">More about me <span>→</span></a>

            <a
              href="https://github.com/Pdoxxy"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noreferrer"
            >
              GitHub <span>↗</span>
            </a>

            <a href="/cv">CV <span>→</span></a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
</Layout>
